Package: calipoppySDM
Title: California Poppy Species Distribution Model — Interactive Shiny App
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Brian", "Jenquist", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "author@example.com")
Description: An interactive Shiny dashboard for fitting and exploring a
    MaxEnt Species Distribution Model (SDM) for the California Poppy
    (Eschscholzia californica). Downloads BIEN occurrence records and WorldClim
    v2.1 (2.5 arc-min) bioclimatic variables, trains a maxnet model with
    user-configurable settings, and presents predicted habitat suitability as
    an interactive leaflet map together with ROC curves, response curves,
    permutation importance, and a full diagnostics table.
